        "Content": "Impressive Three-Bedroom Family Home with Large Private South-East Facing Rear Garden with No Onward Chain\r\nMichael O’Flaherty from LWK is delighted to present No. 211 Palmerstown Avenue to the market, an attractive and generously proportioned three-bedroom mid-terrace family home, ideally positioned on one of Palmerstown’s most established and sought-after residential avenues.\r\n\r\nExtending to approximately 94 sq. m., this fine property offers bright, well-proportioned accommodation throughout, complemented by excellent private outdoor space and a highly convenient location. Presented in excellent condition, No. 211 is sure to appeal to first-time buyers, families and those seeking a comfortable home with excellent potential for further enhancement.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\n●\tThree-bedroom mid-terrace family home\r\n●\tApproximately 94 sq. m.\r\n●\tBER Rating: D\r\n●\tLarge private south-east facing rear garden\r\n●\tRear laneway access\r\n●\tOff-street parking for several cars\r\n●\tTwo Barna sheds\r\n●\tPotential to convert the attic, subject to the necessary planning requirements\r\n●\tGas-fired central heating\r\n●\tTwo generous reception rooms\r\n●\tFireplaces in both reception rooms\r\n●\tWell-appointed kitchen with direct access to the rear garden\r\n●\tDouble-glazed windows\r\n●\tAlarmed\r\n●\tExcellent condition throughout\r\n●\tMature and highly sought-after residential location\r\n●\tExcellent transport links\r\n●\tEasy access to the M50 motorway\r\n●\tClose to local shops, schools and amenities\r\n●\tPhoenix Park within easy reach\r\n\r\nOn entering, a welcoming hallway leads to a comfortable front sitting room, while to the rear is a generous living/dining room, with both reception rooms benefiting from fireplaces that add warmth and character to the accommodation. A well-appointed kitchen is located to the rear and provides direct access to the garden through patio doors. The property also benefits from double-glazed windows, an alarm system and gas-fired central heating.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, there are three well-proportioned bedrooms together with a family bathroom. The bedrooms offer excellent versatility and provide ample space for modern family living. The attic also offers excellent potential for conversion, subject to the necessary planning and building requirements, providing an exciting opportunity for the new owner to further enhance the accommodation.\r\n\r\nA particular highlight of No. 211 is the large, private south-east facing rear garden. Offering excellent natural light and a wonderful sense of privacy, the garden provides an ideal space for outdoor entertaining, relaxing and family use. There are also two Barna sheds, providing valuable additional storage. The property further benefits from laneway access, which is particularly useful and rarely available in properties of this type.\r\n\r\nTo the front, the property enjoys generous off-street parking for several cars, providing excellent convenience for residents and visitors alike.\r\n\r\nThe location is excellent, with Palmerstown Avenue offering a mature and highly regarded residential setting. A wide range of local amenities, including shops, cafés, schools and recreational facilities, are all within easy reach. The area is well served by frequent bus routes providing convenient access to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas, while the M50 motorway is also easily accessible. The Phoenix Park is just minutes away by car.\r\n\r\nCombining generous and well-balanced living accommodation, three excellent bedrooms, a large private south-east facing rear garden, garage, laneway access, generous off-street parking and excellent potential for future enhancement, No. 211 Palmerstown Avenue represents an excellent opportunity to acquire a quality family home in one of Palmerstown’s most established residential areas.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate the generous accommodation, excellent outdoor space and superb potential this fine property has to offer.\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
